Run master.py to gather and prepare data to generate files necessary for R analysis. 

For TRTH preprocessing directly:
  python src/d01_preprocessing/trth_streamed.py [file.gz] --timings --phase2-workers 4
  python src/d01_preprocessing/trth_streamed.py --temp-format parquet --output-format parquet


